# Testing Standards

## Regla principal

**Ninguna tarea se considera completa sin tests verdes.**

Consulta `docs/TASKS.md` para los tests obligatorios de cada ID.

## Backend (pytest)

```bash
cd backend && uv run pytest features/orders/tests/ -v
cd backend && make test-cov
```

- Domain: sin DB, sin Django
- Application: mocks con `unittest.mock` o `pytest-mock`
- Infrastructure: `@pytest.mark.django_db`, `APIClient`, `factory_boy`

## Flutter

```bash
cd flutter-customer && flutter test test/features/auth/
```

- Use cases: `mocktail` para repos
- Widgets: `testWidgets` + `pumpWidget`
- No tests triviales que solo verifican `true == true`

## Al completar tarea

1. Ejecutar tests del módulo
2. Confirmar verde en terminal
3. Actualizar `docs/PROGRESS.md`
